  "html": "<p><strong>Model</strong>: Claude 2 from <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Anthropic</a></p><p><strong>Prompt</strong>: “Write a beautiful and conflicted haiku about life in the 2020s.”</p><p><strong>Output: </strong></p><div><p><em><strong>Bright screens fill our eyes </strong></em></p><p><em><strong>Yet longing for human touch </strong></em></p><p><em><strong>Disconnected souls</strong></em></p></div><p><strong>Prompt: </strong>I then fed that haiku into <a href=\"http://midjourney.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Midjourney</a> as a prompt: <strong>“</strong>Bright screens fill our eyes. Yet longing for human touch. Disconnected souls.”</p><p><strong>Output: </strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/c971020ca23492c8187be415.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/19b11b2ac222933ec24f1651.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div>",
